{"id":"656787","name":"潮汕土豆粿","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/656787/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"土豆","amount":"1500g"},{"name":"番薯粉","amount":"450g"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菇","amount":"适量"},{"name":"干贝","amount":"适量"},{"name":"虾米","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜苗","amount":"适量"},{"name":"肉沫","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"土豆洗净去皮切片。","img":"images/656787/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"泡发好的香菇切小块。","img":"images/656787/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"泡发过的干虾米切小块。","img":"images/656787/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"干贝泡好后用刀背压散开。","img":"images/656787/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"蒜苗洗净切碎。","img":"images/656787/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"前腿肉绞碎成肉沫备用。","img":"images/656787/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"土豆下锅蒸熟。","img":"images/656787/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅中热油放入肉沫。","img":"images/656787/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"将肉沫炒干水份。","img":"images/656787/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入老抽，生抽，蚝油。","img":"images/656787/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"翻炒均匀上色入味。","img":"images/656787/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入香菇，虾米和干贝。","img":"images/656787/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"翻炒均匀炒出香味。","img":"images/656787/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"最后放入蒜苗炒匀即可。","img":"images/656787/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"蒸好的土豆捣成泥。","img":"images/656787/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放入番薯粉，将番薯粉和土豆泥混合揉匀。","img":"images/656787/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"放入炒过的馅料。","img":"images/656787/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"加入五香粉和盐调味。","img":"images/656787/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"揉抓均匀。","img":"images/656787/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"模具均匀抹上干粉。","img":"images/656787/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"面团搓圆后裹上干粉。","img":"images/656787/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"放入模具按压整形。","img":"images/656787/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"印出模型后轻拍即可取出。","img":"images/656787/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"土豆粿一个个摆放上蒸屉，冷水上锅大火蒸12-15分钟左右。","img":"images/656787/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"蒸好后把土豆粿晾凉。","img":"images/656787/step_25.jpg"},{"step":26,"desc":"锅中热油放入土豆粿。","img":"images/656787/step_26.jpg"},{"step":27,"desc":"中小火煎至两面金黄即可。","img":"images/656787/step_27.jpg"},{"step":28,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/656787/step_28.jpg"},{"step":29,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/656787/step_29.jpg"},{"step":30,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/656787/step_30.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}